WEBVTT

00:12.870 --> 00:18.580
ARIFURETA - FROM COMMONPLACE
TO WORLD'S STRONGEST SEASON 3

01:29.990 --> 01:34.990
THE FINAL LABYRINTH

01:50.380 --> 01:53.510
I used to do that on the night
after clearing a Great Labyrinth.

01:53.510 --> 01:55.370
N-Nagumo?

01:55.760 --> 01:57.840
Don't scare me like that.

01:59.970 --> 02:01.850
So you're awake?

02:01.850 --> 02:05.760
Well... I just couldn't sleep...

02:05.760 --> 02:09.120
It's your first time clearing
a Great Labyrinth, after all.

02:09.650 --> 02:11.860
You can't help but feel excited.

02:12.200 --> 02:13.860
R-Right.

02:13.860 --> 02:16.880
Yaegashi, aren't you looking strange?

02:17.310 --> 02:19.370
Could this be an aftereffect?

02:19.370 --> 02:20.120
Huh?

02:20.600 --> 02:22.610
Um, no, I'm fine.

02:22.610 --> 02:24.930
I'm perfectly healthy.

02:24.930 --> 02:26.380
You can say I'm in top form.

02:26.700 --> 02:29.500
No, you're looking so tired to me.

02:29.500 --> 02:31.380
And you're acting suspicious too...

02:31.380 --> 02:33.780
What do you mean suspicious?

02:33.780 --> 02:35.760
I'm perfectly normal.

02:35.760 --> 02:38.920
Well, if you say so, I guess.

02:39.390 --> 02:42.760
What? Why are you coming closer?

02:42.760 --> 02:46.400
Wait, no! I'm sweating a lot!

02:46.400 --> 02:49.650
Oh, the towel?
Here, you can have it back.

02:49.650 --> 02:52.650
Wait, no! I'll wash it first!

02:52.650 --> 02:54.650
Stop right there, will you!

02:55.110 --> 02:57.450
You're really acting strange.

02:57.450 --> 02:59.910
I just want you to give me
your Black Blade.

03:00.830 --> 03:02.960
B-Black Blade?

03:08.410 --> 03:11.020
Looks like we could
enhance this by a lot, Yaegashi.

03:11.020 --> 03:13.920
I meant to use this
to practice my evolution magic,

03:13.920 --> 03:16.530
but this might go better than expected.

03:17.930 --> 03:21.930
I'll evolve all the others'
equipment with this too.

03:22.290 --> 03:24.270
Yeah, thanks.

03:45.680 --> 03:46.680
He...

03:47.230 --> 03:48.550
...saw my sleeping face.

03:54.050 --> 03:55.340
That's the place...

04:02.060 --> 04:04.470
I can't see the surface at all.

04:04.470 --> 04:08.940
The Frost Caverns of Schnee is always
covered in thick clouds.

04:08.940 --> 04:11.020
It's always a blizzard down there.

04:11.020 --> 04:12.730
Truly a land of extreme cold.

04:12.730 --> 04:14.740
The thick clouds and snow field...

04:14.740 --> 04:19.230
It is all so blurred together,
as if there is some kind of invisible boundary.

04:19.990 --> 04:22.390
So, how is it, Hajime?

04:22.390 --> 04:24.490
Is the compass actually working?

04:24.910 --> 04:26.680
Yeah, it's doing fine.

04:26.680 --> 04:30.000
Still, thinking back,
this thing is actually awesome.

04:30.000 --> 04:31.230
Oh...

04:31.230 --> 04:34.500
The needle doesn't only
point to where I want to,

04:34.950 --> 04:38.730
but I could also imagine the destination,
how far it is,

04:38.730 --> 04:40.760
just by feeling.

04:40.760 --> 04:44.360
You could tell the places on Earth too.

04:44.360 --> 04:47.520
Although, the explanation
was a bit too difficult.

04:47.520 --> 04:51.820
In exchange, it used up a lot of mana.

04:52.630 --> 04:55.340
We're finally at our final Great Labyrinth!

04:55.340 --> 04:59.280
Let's clear it quick and go fetch Miu!

04:59.280 --> 05:02.780
Right. I hope she's doing well.

05:04.780 --> 05:06.290
So, how'd it go?

05:06.730 --> 05:08.290
Any defects?

05:08.290 --> 05:11.420
No problem.
My power went up surprisingly.

05:11.420 --> 05:13.690
That was really the stuff.

05:13.690 --> 05:16.940
Now I can fight instead
of just keeping on the defence!

05:16.940 --> 05:18.750
Thanks, Nagumo!

05:20.220 --> 05:25.000
I'm worried if we get too many functions,
not knowing which one to use in real battle,

05:25.530 --> 05:28.040
but I guess we just have
to gain XP from there.

05:28.430 --> 05:31.690
I guess it was worth the modifications.

05:31.690 --> 05:37.190
Still, I'm not really sure about
Amanogawa's Holy Sword.

05:37.190 --> 05:40.120
Wha... Hold it right there, Nagumo!

05:40.120 --> 05:41.950
Why'd you have to put it so ominously?!

05:42.300 --> 05:44.470
That's not what I mean.

05:44.470 --> 05:48.060
The Holy Sword, made to be precise
and exquisitely balanced,

05:48.060 --> 05:52.070
is a perfect special item that
requires no further modifications.

05:52.460 --> 05:54.960
So I just maintained the thing.

05:54.960 --> 05:57.460
I-Is that so?

05:57.930 --> 05:59.310
Don't worry.

06:04.520 --> 06:07.970
The compass says it's further ahead...

06:07.970 --> 06:10.870
But it's impossible
to go forward with Fernir.

06:11.340 --> 06:13.640
So we're finally going outside!

06:13.640 --> 06:15.710
It's my first time seeing snow!

06:15.710 --> 06:19.480
How will it feel?
Will it have a scent?

06:19.480 --> 06:24.990
Master, I am not really
fond of cold places...

06:24.990 --> 06:27.290
All right, we're going down the cliff.

06:27.290 --> 06:29.490
Talk about an act of neglect after a while!

06:34.570 --> 06:35.440
Huh?

06:36.500 --> 06:38.430
It really isn't cold.

06:38.430 --> 06:40.500
All thanks to Hajime.

06:40.500 --> 06:43.510
Wow, so this is snow!

06:43.510 --> 06:45.490
- Come on, Shea.
- So soft!

06:45.490 --> 06:47.510
- Stop frolicking so much.
- I just have to dive into the snow now!

06:47.510 --> 06:49.240
- I just have to dive into the snow now!

06:49.680 --> 06:52.460
I'm snow rabbit from today!

06:56.460 --> 06:59.720
Shortly after, no one has ever
seen the foolish rabbit again.

06:59.720 --> 07:01.440
No one.

07:01.780 --> 07:02.640
Yeah...

07:02.640 --> 07:03.670
No one.

07:03.670 --> 07:06.260
Wait, wait, wait!
How are you guys still calm?!

07:06.260 --> 07:07.950
Shea's going to die!

07:09.430 --> 07:11.950
Sheashea!

07:12.360 --> 07:16.760
As if Shea would be screwed
over falling from high places.

07:17.430 --> 07:20.250
Anyway, we're going down now.

07:22.340 --> 07:25.630
You two! Wait!

07:27.340 --> 07:30.140
There is no point in cowering over such thing.

07:30.660 --> 07:32.910
Is what you are about to do...

07:32.910 --> 07:37.080
...not harder than merely
going down the cliff?

07:37.080 --> 07:39.150
B-But...

07:39.790 --> 07:41.790
There is no time to tremble.

07:42.220 --> 07:45.150
Come on, believe in your eyes
and go all out.

07:45.150 --> 07:48.000
W-Wait! I'll go on my own!

07:48.000 --> 07:50.660
I can do it if I try!

07:50.660 --> 07:52.790
Please let me do it at my own pace!

07:52.790 --> 07:53.660
Down you go!

07:56.160 --> 07:58.360
Sh-Shizuku Yaegashi!

07:58.360 --> 08:00.640
Job: Swordmaster!

08:00.640 --> 08:02.100
Coming down!

08:02.100 --> 08:04.200
I'm going too!

08:04.200 --> 08:07.230
Balls!

08:07.680 --> 08:11.530
Damn it! What will be, will be!

08:17.460 --> 08:20.940
I'm not crying!
I'm not!

08:20.940 --> 08:23.940
Oh, I heard a voice.

08:26.530 --> 08:30.990
Wow, that was quite the trouble.
What a cunning trap.

08:31.450 --> 08:36.290
They're playing with my innocent mind
and luring me into the abyss...

08:36.290 --> 08:37.290
Ouch!

08:37.290 --> 08:38.900
Idiot.

08:38.900 --> 08:42.290
It doesn't change the fact
that this is a dangerous place.

08:42.290 --> 08:43.410
Don't let your guard down.

08:44.160 --> 08:47.550
I'm sorry, I got full of myself...

08:47.550 --> 08:52.300
Well, it kinda warms my heart
to see the poor rabbit again.

08:52.300 --> 08:55.780
You haven't been so pitiful these days,

08:55.780 --> 08:57.310
it felt lonely.

08:57.310 --> 09:00.220
Oh, quit it, will you?

09:00.220 --> 09:03.060
You're saying as if
I'm better off being pitiful.

09:03.060 --> 09:06.160
This warmth could melt down
the snow here.

09:06.160 --> 09:08.740
I'm glad you're happy, Sheashea.

09:09.070 --> 09:10.070
Damn you.

09:10.070 --> 09:11.350
Suzu?!

09:11.350 --> 09:15.830
Did I just hear Suzu
abuse her like never before?

09:16.170 --> 09:19.690
Hey, enough playing around.
We're moving out.

09:22.940 --> 09:24.690
Go straight from here.

09:27.100 --> 09:29.840
Oh? Something's here.

09:41.770 --> 09:43.100
So cute!

09:50.320 --> 09:51.790
Could it be a monster?

09:52.170 --> 09:54.640
How dare you try to fool me
with such a cute look.

09:54.640 --> 09:56.870
Quite a scary characteristic.

09:56.870 --> 09:59.820
Shizuku, you're not fooling anyone.

09:59.820 --> 10:02.620
Shizushizu, your ears are all red.

10:10.890 --> 10:13.840
You sly bastard!

10:15.850 --> 10:19.270
Nagumo, you're a demon!

10:23.520 --> 10:26.020
Tch... They're so annoying.

10:26.020 --> 10:28.020
Rrraah!

10:28.020 --> 10:30.030
Hyeaaah!

10:39.030 --> 10:42.550
Hey, why are you spacing out?!

10:42.550 --> 10:44.330
Get them already!

10:49.960 --> 10:52.810
Watch out for noise and impact,

10:52.810 --> 10:55.040
as snow on the ceiling
could cause an avalanche!

10:55.930 --> 11:00.570
You demon!

11:05.530 --> 11:09.690
Like I said, they were
fully-fledged monsters.

11:12.570 --> 11:16.760
They had unique magic that
absorbs the target's heat.

11:18.090 --> 11:20.890
If you gave in to their cuteness
and hugged them,

11:20.890 --> 11:23.330
it'd be a minute express
ticket to the afterlife.

11:23.860 --> 11:26.200
They might look like that,

11:26.200 --> 11:28.080
but they're demons inside.

11:28.080 --> 11:32.120
Hang on, didn't you notice
when they approached us first?

11:32.530 --> 11:34.480
I guess Yue and Tio could, right?

11:34.840 --> 11:38.340
Yeah. I was too busy comforting Shea.

11:38.340 --> 11:43.100
Seeing Shea in tears made me
feel guilty somehow...

11:43.100 --> 11:47.100
I thought I would just leave it to you
since you were going to do it.

11:47.100 --> 11:49.600
Don't give me that.

11:50.050 --> 11:50.860
Also, Shea.

11:51.280 --> 11:53.030
How long are you gonna keep trembling?

11:53.030 --> 11:55.290
What else do you want me to do?!

11:55.290 --> 11:58.480
I knew it already,
but you didn't hesitate...

11:58.480 --> 12:02.500
And you kept tearing off
those rabbit ears one by one...

12:02.500 --> 12:06.190
A beast is a beast,
and you are you.

12:06.900 --> 12:08.740
You're my only rabbit.

12:09.140 --> 12:11.630
So I have no reason to hesitate.

12:12.090 --> 12:14.220
R-Right...

12:16.260 --> 12:21.230
When seeing her like this,
it really feels like he's accepted her now.

12:21.230 --> 12:24.940
Right. Let us do our best as well, Kaori.

12:24.940 --> 12:28.020
The future where he treats us like that
is just around the corner.

12:28.020 --> 12:29.770
Yeah, let's do our best.

12:29.770 --> 12:33.370
Kaori, are you familiar with
the phrase "wasted effort"?

12:33.370 --> 12:36.530
What do you mean? Huh?

12:39.420 --> 12:44.310
At this rate, Kaorin and Miss Tio
would join his group too.

12:44.790 --> 12:48.050
It's unthinkable if we're in Japan.

12:48.700 --> 12:49.580
Shizushizu?

12:49.580 --> 12:51.790
What is it, Suzu?

12:53.550 --> 12:56.010
It's nothing important...

12:56.480 --> 12:59.940
But are you okay?
You're spacing out.

12:59.940 --> 13:01.790
I'm fine.

13:02.390 --> 13:04.810
I'm sorry, I'll try to focus.

13:06.380 --> 13:09.810
Sheesh, Kaori did it again.

13:10.340 --> 13:12.390
Always so quick to pick a fight.

13:12.840 --> 13:14.060
Right, Koki?

13:14.060 --> 13:14.840
Huh?

13:15.380 --> 13:17.560
Y-Yeah, right.

13:18.060 --> 13:20.750
She used to admonish us before.

13:23.020 --> 13:24.510
Such unpleasant wind.

13:25.120 --> 13:27.080
This is quite annoying.

13:31.370 --> 13:33.000
We're going right here.

13:33.640 --> 13:36.590
Looks like we have to go against the wind.

13:40.910 --> 13:43.320
A blizzard that causes frostbites...

13:44.260 --> 13:45.100
Tio.

13:45.100 --> 13:46.600
Understood.

13:48.250 --> 13:49.980
Wait, Miss Tio!

13:50.490 --> 13:52.600
Let me do that!

13:52.600 --> 13:56.360
I guess you need to practice it first
before using it in real battle.

13:56.360 --> 14:00.030
Hmm. You heard him.

14:00.030 --> 14:02.940
Suzu, I shall leave it to you.

14:04.040 --> 14:05.800
Arise, Twin Iron Fans.

14:06.310 --> 14:08.850
All right, here I go!

14:08.850 --> 14:10.590
Hallowed Ground - Scatter!

14:14.630 --> 14:17.040
Oh, nice job, Suzu!

14:17.040 --> 14:19.380
Yeah, this isn't half bad.

14:32.080 --> 14:32.890
Over there.

14:43.740 --> 14:46.360
The entrance to the Frost Caverns...

15:10.970 --> 15:12.790
Mister Hajime, something's coming.

15:12.790 --> 15:15.270
Monsters? Finally, some action.

15:38.000 --> 15:39.300
Damn.

15:43.010 --> 15:46.090
So that thing controls the monsters?

15:46.090 --> 15:49.090
In that case...
I'll blow you to kingdom come!

15:51.850 --> 15:52.730
Tch.

15:52.730 --> 15:57.680
Master, it seems like the same kind of monster
as the Bachulum in the oasis.

15:58.200 --> 15:59.610
That is not a wall,

15:59.610 --> 16:01.360
but a monster mimicking one.

16:01.360 --> 16:03.260
Seems like it.

16:03.260 --> 16:04.590
Well, then...

16:04.590 --> 16:06.110
Everyone, stay focused!

16:06.550 --> 16:10.620
Think of all the surrounding ice as hostiles!

16:41.830 --> 16:42.770
Well...

16:43.330 --> 16:47.780
I guess I have to break through its armour
and destroy its magic stone.

16:48.610 --> 16:51.720
Will I be consumed by the monsters first now?

16:51.720 --> 16:53.780
I guess that's the trial here.

17:04.580 --> 17:05.300
Nagumo!

17:05.300 --> 17:08.950
I'll deal with the scrubs.
Go on ahead.

17:09.300 --> 17:11.110
I can do this too!

17:11.110 --> 17:12.920
I'll defeat that thing!

17:13.280 --> 17:16.060
Ryotaro, Shizuku, Suzu, let's go!

17:16.060 --> 17:19.330
Yeah, let's knock them flying!

17:19.330 --> 17:22.760
I'll back you up.
Watch out for the ice pillars behind.

17:22.760 --> 17:24.560
I'm sure something will come out.

17:24.560 --> 17:28.320
Leave the defence to me.
I'll block it all.

17:33.660 --> 17:36.620
Go! Don't be reckless, everyone!

17:37.870 --> 17:40.030
You're fighting me now!

17:40.030 --> 17:42.080
Celestial Flash!

17:50.090 --> 17:52.300
Like the flowing water,

17:52.300 --> 17:54.280
like the spinning wind!

17:54.760 --> 17:56.100
Hallowed Ground - Scatter!

17:59.060 --> 17:59.600
Wha...

18:00.630 --> 18:03.280
The head and eyes
are regenerating already.

18:03.280 --> 18:05.480
As long as the magic stone is there,

18:05.480 --> 18:08.920
it seems to be able to regenerate infinitely.

18:09.380 --> 18:11.180
We have to finish it with one strike.

18:11.180 --> 18:13.110
Yeah. I'll go with Kamui.

18:13.790 --> 18:16.770
I want to unleash my full power.
Buy me some time!

18:16.770 --> 18:18.050
Okay.

18:18.050 --> 18:20.370
I won't let the thing touch you.

18:20.750 --> 18:23.120
Everyone, its breath is getting weaker!

18:23.450 --> 18:26.890
Ryutaro, Shizuku, deal with the thing.

18:26.890 --> 18:28.630
Suzu, you stay by my side!

18:29.110 --> 18:30.620
I'll focus on my chanting!

18:30.620 --> 18:31.810
Roger that!

18:31.810 --> 18:33.880
I'm counting on you to the fullest!

18:38.930 --> 18:40.850
Activate spatial magic!

18:41.210 --> 18:42.230
Cut away!

18:43.310 --> 18:43.980
Flash Blitz!

18:46.440 --> 18:47.570
Flash Blitz!

18:54.820 --> 18:56.740
No, you won't!

18:59.620 --> 19:00.540
Shizuku!

19:10.870 --> 19:12.090
That one just now...

19:13.590 --> 19:15.590
He shot from over there...

19:15.590 --> 19:17.840
...without even looking...

19:17.840 --> 19:20.280
Don't get too cocky!

19:20.850 --> 19:23.350
Activate gravity magic!

19:23.970 --> 19:26.190
Hammerfist!

19:27.190 --> 19:29.310
Shizuku, Ryutaro, stand back!

19:29.310 --> 19:30.030
Copy!

19:30.030 --> 19:31.320
I've been waiting for this!

19:33.320 --> 19:35.320
Here goes, monster!

19:35.320 --> 19:36.780
Kamui!

19:48.500 --> 19:51.550
Begone... Begone now!

19:51.550 --> 19:55.590
I need more power!

20:16.190 --> 20:18.410
I... did it...

20:18.410 --> 20:20.480
I defeated it...

20:21.140 --> 20:21.660
Me...

20:21.660 --> 20:23.910
Koki! Are you...

20:26.680 --> 20:28.210
Look!

20:28.210 --> 20:28.830
Damn!

20:29.450 --> 20:31.270
I couldn't completely finish it off!

20:32.240 --> 20:34.590
You're not going anywhere!

20:35.180 --> 20:36.410
Celestial...

20:37.120 --> 20:38.840
Koki, don't be too reckless!

20:39.160 --> 20:40.520
I can do it.

20:41.190 --> 20:43.440
I must...

20:44.150 --> 20:46.290
I'm better than Nagumo...

20:46.790 --> 20:48.850
I'm the right one...

20:54.920 --> 20:56.790
Slash them!
Twin Flash!

21:40.940 --> 21:42.910
Hey, what's wrong, Koki?

21:42.910 --> 21:45.660
Did you hear something just now?

21:46.080 --> 21:46.790
Huh?

21:47.740 --> 21:49.660
Nah, nothing.

21:50.650 --> 21:51.710
That so...

23:32.930 --> 23:34.840
CHARGING EMOTIONS

23:34.840 --> 23:37.750
CHARGING EMOTIONS
Next episode: Charging Emotions.

23:37.750 --> 23:40.900
CHARGING EMOTIONS
